3. SCOPE — WHAT THIS IS NOT
This repository is an in-process REFERENCE implementation: it contains the
danger-rule surface, the schema profiling layer and the evidence-view
normalization tier. It does NOT contain and must not be mistaken for the
production Correctover engine. The proprietary pieces that are deliberately
excluded are:
  - the independent, cross-process fail-closed verifier;
  - the pinned Ed25519 trust root and the signed adjudication-receipt kernel;
  - the fail-closed IPC transport.
The verification STANDARD those pieces implement is open; see STANDARD.md.

4. SEALED HOLDOUT
